## Now Let's Connect This to SYSTEM PROGRAMMING

This pattern you just understood is EVERYWHERE in systems code:

```rust
// Reading from files
let content = fs::read_to_string("config.toml")?;
let config: Config = toml::from_str(&content)
    .map_err(|e| format!("Failed to parse config: {}", e))?;

// Network operations
let response = http_client.get(url)
    .map_err(|e| format!("Network error: {}", e))?;

// System calls
let pid = std::process::id()?; // Could fail!
```

**You're building the mental models for ALL of these!**

