## The Pattern You're Learning

```rust
// Conversion chain pattern (you just mastered this):
value.parse()
    .map_err(|_| "error")?;
    // Option/Result → Transformation → ? → Value or early return

// Ownership transfer pattern (linked list):
self.head.take()  // Takes ownership, leaves None
// OR
std::mem::replace(&mut self.head, Some(Box::new(...))) // Swap values
```

**These 2 patterns = 90% of Rust systems programming!**

